exit 0
# The built-in OWASP CRS v4, for the policies that tune it or add rules.
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: ClusterWAFRuleSet
metadata:
  name: owasp-crs-v4
spec:
  source:
    builtin: crs-v4
---
# From the ingress-nginx ModSecurity settings of Ingress shop/web.
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: WAFRuleSet
metadata:
  name: web-modsecurity-before-crs
  namespace: shop
spec:
  source:
    seclang: |
      # annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 2
      SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /static*" "id:1001,phase:1,pass,nolog,ctl:ruleEngine=Off"
      # annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 3
      SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /search*" "id:1002,phase:1,pass,nolog,ctl:ruleRemoveById=942100"
---
apiVersion: waf.inkwall.dev/v1alpha1
kind: WAFPolicy
metadata:
  name: web
  namespace: shop
spec:
  exclusions:
  - ruleIDs:
    - 920100
    when:
      path: /form*
  mode: Block
  ruleSets:
  - placement: BeforeCRS
    ref:
      kind: WAFRuleSet
      name: web-modsecurity-before-crs
  - ref:
      kind: ClusterWAFRuleSet
      name: owasp-crs-v4
  targetRefs:
  - kind: Ingress
    name: web
--- stderr
note: no ConfigMap ingress-nginx/ingress-nginx-controller in the files: ModSecurity is taken as off globally (only the annotations count)
Ingress shop/web: WAFPolicy shop/web (Block), WAFRuleSet shop/web-modsecurity-before-crs
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 2: kept in the BeforeCRS WAFRuleSet: SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /static*" "id:1001,phase:1,pass,nolog,ctl:ruleEngine=Off"; ModSecurity ran it before the CRS, and placement: BeforeCRS needs engines 0.6.0 or later (older ones load it after the CRS)
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 3: kept in the BeforeCRS WAFRuleSet: SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@streq /search*" "id:1002,phase:1,pass,nolog,ctl:ruleRemoveById=942100"; ModSecurity ran it before the CRS, and placement: BeforeCRS needs engines 0.6.0 or later (older ones load it after the CRS)
  mapped  annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 4: SecRule REQUEST_FILENAME "@beginsWith /form" "id:1003,phase:request,pass,nolog,ctl:ruleRemoveById=920100": exclusions on /form*
  check   annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 4: the rule ran in phase 2; Inkwall applies exclusions from phase 1, so the excluded rules' phase 1 checks are off on /form* too
  mapped  annotation enable-owasp-core-rules: the built-in OWASP CRS v4
  mapped  annotation modsecurity-snippet, line 1: SecRuleEngine On: mode: Block
